              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farawo akankamira Mose ati: “Mva imbere, sinzosubire kukubona imbere yanje! Nkazosubira kukubona nzokwica.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
